.SH NAME
ERR_remove_thread_state, ERR_remove_state \- DEPRECATED
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
Deprecated:
.PP
.Vb 3
\& #if OPENSSL_API_COMPAT < 0x10000000L
