L\fBOPENSSL_init_crypto\fR\|(3)
.SH HISTORY
.IX Header "HISTORY"
\&\fBERR_remove_state()\fR was deprecated in OpenSSL 1.0.0 when
\&\fBERR_remove_thread_state()\fR was introduced.
.PP
\&\fBERR_remove_thread_state()\fR was deprecated in OpenSSL 1.1.0 when the
thread handling functionality was entirely rewritten.
